"text": "Share on LinkedIn",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122135650257359074&title=%09Recent+reports+of+threats+surrounding+local+sporting+events+are+deeply+concerning.+Our+schools+and+athletic+events+should+be+places+where+students%2C+families%2C+and+communities+can+come+together+without+fear+for+their+safety.My+thoughts+and+prayers+are+with+our+students%2C+families%2C+coaches%2C+and+everyone+affected+by+these+concerns.I+also+want+to+express+my+sincere+appreciation+for+our+local+law+enforcement+officers+who+work+every+day+to+keep+our+communities+safe.+Their+dedication%2C+professionalism%2C+and+willingness+to+put+themselves+in+harm%E2%80%99s+way+do+not+go+unnoticed.Thank+you+to+all+who+work+to+protect+our+communities.+Please+stay+safe%2C+look+out+for+one+another%2C+and+keep+everyone+affected+in+your+prayers.+%09%09"
},
