"text": "Share on LinkedIn",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122135857395359074&title=%09Fraud+is+stealing+from+Minnesota+taxpayers%2C+and+we+need+to+hold+those+responsible+accountable.We+also+need+to+make+sure+the+people+who+truly+need+a+hand+up+are+the+ones+receiving+it.My+work+as+a+Benton+County+Commissioner+has+given+me+an+in-depth+look+at+the+outdated+technology+used+at+the+state+level+to+administer+these+programs.+These+antiquated+systems+not+only+create+unnecessary+work+and+delays+for+employees+entering+data%2C+but+they+also+lack+the+checks+and+balances+needed+to+help+prevent+fraud.In+a+time+when+so+much+information+is+available+at+our+fingertips+and+Minnesotans+expect+government+to+work+efficiently%2C+our+state+systems+need+to+catch+up.We+need+modern+technology%2C+stronger+safeguards%2C+and+greater+accountability+to+protect+taxpayer+dollars+while+making+sure+assistance+reaches+the+people+it+is+intended+to+serve.www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23mnleg+%23MNSenate+%23District13+%23MNFraud+%23MNPolitics+%23Vote2026+%23mnvotes+%23GOP+%23gapinskiformnsenate+%09%09"
